#   css_animation - CSS::CSSAnimation: an animation made from the animation-* properties
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/CSS/CSSAnimation.cpp (lines 1-153) with the inline members of
#       CSSAnimation.h, by region p4a: creating one, its composite order and animation class,
#       applying the computed animation-* properties to it and its keyframe effect (timeline,
#       duration, delay, iteration count, easing, fill mode, direction, composition, and
#       playing or pausing it), and setting its timeline from script.
